Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:47.66,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,EPISODE 6 - MISAKI, SESEKALI MAU BERJUANG SENDIRIAN!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.25,0:02:25.74,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,KERETA API SHIMABARA
