Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.56,0:06:54.12,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,KLUB TETSURYO
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.13,0:06:56.80,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,KLUB TETSURYO
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:58.35,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,KLUB TETSURYO
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.14,0:10:17.89,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,MENIKMATI KOTA METROPOLITAN!
